Adds validation in DevicePolicyManagerService to ensure that the total
number of application restrictions set on a device cannot exceed 1000
packages.
This limit is enforced globally across all admins combined by using
`getLocalPolicyKeysSetByAllAdmins`, ensuring that multiple Profile Owners
or Delegated Apps cannot bypass the cap.
Also includes comprehensive unit test coverage to validate the
enforcement for both single-admin and multi-admin configurations.

